             6:50 PM - 9:30 PM  Main Presentation

             ----------------------------------------------------------
     Topic:  LTSP - Linux Terminal Server Project (including EtherBoot)
             ----------------------------------------------------------

   Speaker:  Andrew Williams,
             VarTech Solutions; and LTSP <http://www.ltsp.org>


